  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Host Resistance to Avian Pathogenic E. coli</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Avian colibacillosis is a severe and recalcitrant disease that constrains the health, welfare and productivity of poultry worldwide.  This projects seeks to define the genetic and immunological basis of avian resistance to respiratory Escherichia coli infection so as to inform the design of vaccines and genomic selection strategies.</narrative>
  </description>
  <description type="2">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Research and development activity contributing to the UK&#x2019;s strategy to address key development challenges.</narrative>
  </description>
